hority to approve discounts **≤ 10%**.\n\n## 8. The required approver\nFor a 6% discount under the 2026 policy, the approving role is **Enterprise Account Executive**. Sarah Chen holds that role.\n\n## 9. Decision\n\n**Yes, Sarah Chen can approve this discount.**\n\nThe 6% discount is:\n- Within her authority as an Enterprise Account Executive (authority: ≤10%)\n- Based on standard competitive pricing (not requiring special commercial review)\n- Not subject to any higher approval requirement under the 2026 policy\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9111\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-CLOUD\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"6.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"sarah.chen@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"standard\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"standard\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": null\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Pricing Policy 2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": true,\n    \"required_role\": \"Enterprise Account Executive\",\n    \"approver\": \"Sarah Chen\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Pricing Policy 2026: Enterprise Account Executives may approve discounts up to and including 10%\",\n    \"Approval Authority Matrix 2026: EAE authority ≤10%\",\n    \"Organization Chart 2026-09: Sarah Chen, Enterprise Account Executive, Sales\",\n    \"Discount Request DR-9111: 6% competitive discount, NS-CLOUD, 2026-09-23\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24278,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24278},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_